{
  "slug": "base44",
  "name": "Base44",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build and deploy Base44 full-stack apps with CLI project management and JavaScript/TypeScript SDK development skills",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `base44-cli` (The base44 CLI is used for EVERYTHING related to base44 projects: resource configuration (entities, backend functions, ai agents),…), `base44-remote-dev` (Develop a Base44 app remotely from your own coding agent (Claude Code, claude.ai, or any MCP client) by…), `base44-sandbox` (Develop a Base44 app remotely inside Base44's cloud sandbox using your own agent — no local checkout and…), `base44-sdk` (The base44 SDK is the library to communicate with base44 services), `base44-troubleshooter` (Troubleshoot production issues using backend function logs and workflow run history)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install base44@claude-plugins-official` from `base44/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
